{"id":1430094,"date":"2026-01-06T17:05:20","date_gmt":"2026-01-06T16:05:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/?p=1430094"},"modified":"2026-02-03T10:48:33","modified_gmt":"2026-02-03T09:48:33","slug":"biscotte-a-la-madeleine","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-famdt\/biscotte-a-la-madeleine\/","title":{"rendered":"BIScotte \u00e0 la Madeleine"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Mercredi 21 janvier <\/strong><br><strong>\u2013 18h &gt; 22h45 \u2013 <\/strong><br><strong>Entr\u00e9e gratuite, tout public. <\/strong><br><strong>Maison de quartier de la Madeleine Champ-de-Mars \u00e0 Nantes<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dans le cadre des <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bis2026.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BIS<\/a>, \u00e9v\u00e8nement professionnel qui se tient \u00e0 Nantes, la <a href=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">LMELB<\/a> et <a href=\"https:\/\/bws.bzh\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bretagnes World Sounds<\/a> s&rsquo;associent pour proposer une soir\u00e9e de Showcases (ap\u00e9ro offert) avec :<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"550\" height=\"367\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Nicolas_Bonneau_Sylvain_Giro_Jeanne_Paturel_HD-4small-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1438134\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Nicolas_Bonneau_Sylvain_Giro_Jeanne_Paturel_HD-4small-1.jpg 550w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Nicolas_Bonneau_Sylvain_Giro_Jeanne_Paturel_HD-4small-1-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong>Sylvain GirO et Nicolas Bonneau<\/strong> <br><strong>&#8211; <em>Les disparu\u00b7es de Nantes<\/em><\/strong><br><strong>18h &gt; 19h<\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Le musicien Sylvain GirO et le conteur Nicolas Bonneau s&rsquo;associent pour raconter l&rsquo;affaire Troadec, meurtre familial survenu en 2017, en revisitant la complainte criminelle.<br> <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sylvaingiro.com\/creation\/les-disparu%c2%b7e%c2%b7s-de-nantes\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">+ d&rsquo;infos<\/a><\/strong> (Cie Un peu moins de gravit\u00e9 \/ La Volige)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"703\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/DUODUBAS-rec-1024x703.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1430468\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/DUODUBAS-rec-1024x703.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/DUODUBAS-rec-300x206.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/DUODUBAS-rec-768x528.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/DUODUBAS-rec-1536x1055.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/DUODUBAS-rec.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong>Duo Du Bas<\/strong><br><strong>19h15 &gt; 19h45<\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Avec complicit\u00e9 et sensibilit\u00e9, deux voix (H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Jacquelot et Elsa Corre), se m\u00ealent, chantent et racontent leur curiosit\u00e9 de l\u2019autre et du vivant au rythme d\u2019objets du quotidien qu\u2019elles se plaisent \u00e0 d\u00e9tourner.<br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.la-criee.com\/project\/dedansdehors2025\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">+ d&rsquo;infos<\/a><\/strong> (La Cri\u00e9e)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/EMEZI_\u00a9Charlaine-Croguennec-6-OK-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1432013\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/EMEZI_\u00a9Charlaine-Croguennec-6-OK-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/EMEZI_\u00a9Charlaine-Croguennec-6-OK-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/EMEZI_\u00a9Charlaine-Croguennec-6-OK-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/EMEZI_\u00a9Charlaine-Croguennec-6-OK.jpg 1309w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong>Emezi<br>20h &gt; 20h30<\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Emezi est un groupe p\u00e9tillant m\u00ealant pop et RnB. Son originalit\u00e9 : des textes chant\u00e9s en breton dans un style r\u00e9solument novateur. Entre harmonies vocales aff\u00fbt\u00e9es et un groove qui fait danser, Emezi fait vibrer la sc\u00e8ne avec un spectacle \u00ab tomm \u00bb (chaud) !<br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/emezi.bzh\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">+ d&rsquo;infos<\/a><\/strong> (Big Bravo Spectacles)<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"651\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/VODEN-1024x651.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1430682\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/VODEN-1024x651.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/VODEN-300x191.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/VODEN-768x488.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/VODEN-1536x977.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/VODEN-2048x1302.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong>V\u00f3den <\/strong><br><strong>&#8211; <em>P\u00e9riph\u00e9rie<\/em><br>20h45 &gt; 21h15<\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Avec <em>P\u00e9riph\u00e9rie<\/em>, le duo V\u00f3den sort du sentier des musiques traditionnelles pour explorer ses compositions dans une esth\u00e9tique au bord du jazz, du rock et de la folk-transe (vielle \u00e0 roue\/nyckelharpa &#8211; inspiration Su\u00e8de\/Bulgarie). <br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.simyaprod.com\/artistes\/voden\/peripherie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">+ d&rsquo;infos<\/a><\/strong> (Simya Productions)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"681\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/arbreadanser\u00a9-Susy-Lagrange-LD-scaled-1-1024x681.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1430686\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/arbreadanser\u00a9-Susy-Lagrange-LD-scaled-1-1024x681.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/arbreadanser\u00a9-Susy-Lagrange-LD-scaled-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/arbreadanser\u00a9-Susy-Lagrange-LD-scaled-1-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/arbreadanser\u00a9-Susy-Lagrange-LD-scaled-1-1536x1022.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/arbreadanser\u00a9-Susy-Lagrange-LD-scaled-1-2048x1362.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong>L&rsquo;Arbre \u00e0 Danser <\/strong><br><strong>&#8211; <em>Version Ram\u00e8ne ta danse<\/em><\/strong> !<br><strong>21h30 &gt; 22h<\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">3 musiciens et 1 danseuse de&nbsp;<em>L&rsquo;Arbre \u00e0 Danser<\/em>&nbsp;partagent des danses venues d&rsquo;ici et d&rsquo;ailleurs collect\u00e9es aupr\u00e8s d&rsquo;habitant\u00b7es. Toi aussi, tu as une danse&nbsp;? Viens nous la montrer et dansons ensemble ! <br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/compagnie-systemeb.com\/larbre-a-danser\/\">+ d&rsquo;infos<\/a><\/strong> (Cie Syst\u00e8me B)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Little_Big_Noz_2NB2RonanLeGourierec\u00a9Eric_Legret-2048x1365-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1430690\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Little_Big_Noz_2NB2RonanLeGourierec\u00a9Eric_Legret-2048x1365-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Little_Big_Noz_2NB2RonanLeGourierec\u00a9Eric_Legret-2048x1365-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Little_Big_Noz_2NB2RonanLeGourierec\u00a9Eric_Legret-2048x1365-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Little_Big_Noz_2NB2RonanLeGourierec\u00a9Eric_Legret-2048x1365-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/Little_Big_Noz_2NB2RonanLeGourierec\u00a9Eric_Legret-2048x1365-1.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong>Little Big Noz<\/strong><br><strong><em>\u2013 Invite&#8230;<\/em><br>22h15 &gt; 22h45<\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Muni d\u2019un saxophone baryton \u00e0 simple carburation circulaire, Ronan Le Gouri\u00e9rec&nbsp;invite Chlo\u00e9 Cailleton (voix et grosse caisse) et Gweltaz Herv\u00e9 (saxophone) \u00e0&nbsp;faire danser, enfants et parents, de tous \u00e2ges, tous niveaux, toutes morphologies et tous milieux sociaux confondus. Ils jouent et improvisent joyeusement autour d\u2019un r\u00e9pertoire original.<br><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/collectifalenvers.org\/little-big-noz\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">+ d&rsquo;infos<\/a><\/strong> (Collectif \u00e0 l&rsquo;Envers)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Entr\u00e9e libre et gratuite. Attention, petite jauge.<\/strong><br><strong>Adresse : Maison de quartier Madeleine &#8211; Champs de Mars<\/strong> (Grand Atelier), acc\u00e8s <a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/place\/\/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x4805eeb06c0d31c7:0x66e3fb0fddc5b99d?sa=X&amp;ved=1t:8290&amp;ictx=111\">10 Rue Monteil, 44000 Nantes<\/a>, tout proche (450m) de la Cit\u00e9 des Congr\u00e8s o\u00f9 se d\u00e9roule les BIS &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.fr\/maps\/dir\/Cit%C3%A9+des+Congr%C3%A8s+de+Nantes,+Rue+de+Valmy,+Nantes\/47.2133867,-1.5479058\/@47.2130361,-1.5472098,361m\/data=!3m1!1e3!4m9!4m8!1m5!1m1!1s0x4805eeb76f5fce7f:0xede2746ae20dfebf!2m2!1d-1.54362!2d47.2129857!1m0!3e2?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDEwNi4wIKXMDSoKLDEwMDc5MjA3M0gBUAM%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Voir l&rsquo;itin\u00e9raire ici.<\/a> <br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-butto